# Option A — stock OpenWiki (no code patch): use openai provider + shell env
# OPENAI_BASE_URL is ignored if only set in ~/.openwiki/.env (deprecated there).
# Export it in the shell when launching openwiki:
#
#   export OPENAI_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000/v1
#   export OPENAI_API_KEY="$LITELLM_MASTER_KEY"
#
# Then in ~/.openwiki/.env:

OPENWIKI_PROVIDER=openai
OPENAI_API_KEY=replace-with-LITELLM_MASTER_KEY
OPENWIKI_MODEL_ID=manager-fast-turbo

# Option B — preferred long-term: add ai-gateway provider to openwiki constants
# (see config/clients/openwiki.ai-gateway.provider.ts.snippet) and set:
# OPENWIKI_PROVIDER=ai-gateway
